@revert_cuts
title: Revert general austerity measures
view-if: economy_cuts > 0
subtitle: \[-1 budget\]
choose-if: government_budget > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough budget.
on-arrival: {!
    G.deactivateLaw(Q, "general_cuts_" + Q.economy_cuts, undefined, true);
    Q.economy_cuts -= 1;
    Q.government_budget -= 1
!}

Some spending cuts have been reverted, and austerity halted, at least for now. There's still much work to do before we're back to pre-2008 levels, though.

